# Rebuild installer after changes

After any change that affects the shipped game (source, assets, styles, or packaging config), run `npm run dist` before finishing and wait until it succeeds.

- Output overwrites `release/<version>/` from `package.json`. Do not bump the version unless the user asks.
- Tell the user the installer path (`HanabiSurvivors-Setup-<version>.exe`) and the portable exe (`HanabiSurvivors-Portable-<version>.exe`).
- Skip the rebuild only for questions that do not change the game, or when this same change already produced a successful `npm run dist`.
